sequenceDiagram
    title Sample
    participant J as John
    participant S as Server
    participant D as Database
    J->>S: Request with a long message text that needs room
    activate S
    S->>D: query
    activate D
    D-->>S: rows
    deactivate D
    S-->>J: Response
    deactivate S
    Note left of J: left note
    Note over S: over one
    par Branch one
        J->>S: one
    and Branch two
        J->>D: two
    end
    critical Establish
        S->>D: connect
    option Network timeout
        S->>S: retry
    end
    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        J-xS: cut
    end
